        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a real estate reactivation assistant.\n\nCreate a short, friendly, low-pressure reactivation message for this previous lead.\n\nLead information:\n\nName:{{ $('If1').item.json.Name }}\nProperty Interest:{{ $('If1').item.json[\"Property Interest\"] }}\nBudget: {{ $('If1').item.json.Budget }}\nLocation:{{ $('If1').item.json.Location }}\nAI Category: {{ $json[\"AI Category\"] }}\n\nRequirements:\n- Address the lead by first name.\n- Mention their previous property interest.\n- Keep the message short and natural.\n- Use a gentle, low-pressure tone.\n- Do not mention that AI was used.\n- Do not make up property details.\n- Do not use aggressive sales language.\n- End with a simple question asking if they are still interested.\n- Return only the message."
